{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"node-model-contract","type":"text","text":"### 1️⃣ CONTRATOS I/O: Drawer Data & Result\n```typescript\n// Parámetros que recibe el Drawer al abrirse\nexport interface OrderFormDrawerData {\n  supplierId?: string;\n  mode: 'create' | 'edit';\n}\n\n// Resultado que devuelve el Drawer al cerrarse\nexport interface OrderFormDrawerResult {\n  created: boolean;\n  order?: PurchaseOrder;\n}\n```\n📌 **Propósito**: Desacopla la página padre del modal con contratos de entrada y salida fuertemente tipados.","x":-520,"y":340,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-service-actions","type":"text","text":"### 2️⃣ SERVICIO: Métodos y Mutaciones Puras\n```typescript\n  // Mutación atómica e inmutable\n  addOrder(order: PurchaseOrder): void {\n    this._orders.update(list => [order, ...list]);\n  }\n\n  updateStatus(id: string, status: PurchaseOrderStatus): void {\n    this._orders.update(list =>\n      list.map(o => o.id === id ? { ...o, status } : o)\n    );\n  }\n```\n📌 **Propósito**: Encapsula las reglas de actualización y llamadas HTTP (activando loadingInterceptor).","x":-40,"y":340,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-smart-overlay","type":"text","text":"### 3️⃣ ORQUESTACIÓN: Apertura de Drawers\n```typescript\n  openNewOrder(): void {\n    const sheetRef = this.bottomSheet.open(\n      NewOrderDrawerComponent,\n      { data: { mode: 'create' } }\n    );\n\n    // Recibe resultado al cerrar el drawer\n    sheetRef.afterDismissed().subscribe(result => {\n      if (result?.created && result.order) {\n        this.ordersSvc.addOrder(result.order);\n      }\n    });\n  }\n```\n📌 **Propósito**: Abre overlays desacoplados y actualiza el estado a través del servicio.","x":440,"y":370,"width":440,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-dumb-component","type":"text","text":"### 4️⃣ DUMB UI: Componentes Compartidos (stp-*)\n```typescript\n// Reciben datos con input() y emiten con output()\n<stp-badge [variant]=\"order.status === 'confirmed' ? 'success' : 'warning'\">\n  {{ order.status }}\n</stp-badge>\n\n<stp-input [(value)]=\"form.supplierName\" label=\"Proveedor\" />\n<stp-button variant=\"primary\" (click)=\"submit()\">Guardar</stp-button>\n```\n📌 **Propósito**: Elementos visuales reutilizables, 100% agnósticos del dominio.","x":960,"y":370,"width":420,"height":470,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-model-domain","type":"text","text":"### 1️⃣ MODELOS: Entidad de Dominio\n```typescript\n// Modelo canónico del negocio\nexport interface PurchaseOrder {\n  id: string;\n  orderNumber: string;\n  supplierName: string;\n  status: PurchaseOrderStatus;\n  items: OrderItem[];\n  totalAmount: number;\n  createdAt: string;\n}\n```\n📌 **Propósito**: Define la estructura y tipos estrictos de los datos del negocio sin lógica de interfaz.","x":-560,"y":-400,"width":400,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-service-state","type":"text","text":"### 2️⃣ SERVICIO: Estado con Signals (@Injectable)\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: 'root' })\nexport class PurchaseOrdersService {\n  // 1. Estado mutable privado (Single Source of Truth)\n  private readonly _orders = signal<PurchaseOrder[]>([]);\n\n  // 2. Estado público inmutable para componentes\n  readonly orders = this._orders.asReadonly();\n}\n```\n📌 **Propósito**: Centraliza el estado reactivo. Los componentes nunca mutan el estado directamente.","x":-60,"y":-280,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-smart-component","type":"text","text":"### 3️⃣ SMART COMPONENT: Página Contenedora\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: 'stp-purchase-orders',\n  imports: [CommonModule, ButtonComponent, BadgeComponent]\n})\nexport class PurchaseOrdersComponent {\n  // Inyección funcional en Angular 21\n  private ordersSvc = inject(PurchaseOrdersService);\n  private bottomSheet = inject(MatBottomSheet);\n\n  // Lectura reactiva y derivados automáticos\n  protected orders = this.ordersSvc.orders;\n  protected pendingCount = computed(() =>\n    this.orders().filter(o => o.status === 'pending').length\n  );\n}\n```\n📌 **Propósito**: Conecta datos del servicio con la vista y orquesta las interacciones del usuario.","x":360,"y":-440,"width":440,"height":310,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-drawer-component","type":"text","text":"### 4️⃣ OVERLAY: Drawer Component\n```typescript\n@Component({ selector: 'stp-new-order-drawer' })\nexport class NewOrderDrawerComponent {\n  // Inyecta datos recibidos y referencia del modal\n  private data = inject<OrderFormDrawerData>(MAT_BOTTOM_SHEET_DATA);\n  private ref = inject(MatBottomSheetRef);\n\n  protected submit(orderData: PurchaseOrder): void {\n    // Cierra el drawer emitiendo el contrato de resultado\n    this.ref.dismiss({ created: true, order: orderData });\n  }\n}\n```\n📌 **Propósito**: Vista modal autocontenida que opera sobre su propio ciclo de vida e inputs.","x":960,"y":-360,"width":420,"height":310,"color":"2"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"edge-model-to-service","fromNode":"node-model-domain","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-service-state","toSide":"left","label":"1. Tipa estado (_orders)"},
		{"id":"edge-contract-to-smart","fromNode":"node-model-contract","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-smart-overlay","toSide":"left","label":"Tipa entrada/salida de Drawer"},
		{"id":"edge-service-to-smart","fromNode":"node-service-state","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-smart-component","toSide":"left","label":"2. inject() + lee .asReadonly()"},
		{"id":"edge-smart-to-service-mut","fromNode":"node-smart-overlay","fromSide":"left","toNode":"node-service-actions","toSide":"right","label":"5. Invoca addOrder() / mutación"},
		{"id":"edge-smart-to-drawer","fromNode":"node-smart-overlay","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-drawer-component","toSide":"left","label":"3. bottomSheet.open({ data })"},
		{"id":"edge-drawer-to-smart","fromNode":"node-drawer-component","fromSide":"left","toNode":"node-smart-overlay","toSide":"top","label":"4. dismiss(result) via afterDismissed"},
		{"id":"edge-smart-to-dumb","fromNode":"node-smart-component","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-dumb-component","toSide":"top","label":"Pasa datos por input() en template"},
		{"id":"edge-drawer-to-dumb","fromNode":"node-drawer-component","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node-dumb-component","toSide":"top","label":"Usa stp-input / stp-button en formulario"}
	]
}